{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52761","headline":"句 · 孟浩然","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日暮马行疾，城荒人住稀。\n（见宋葛立方《韵语阳秋》卷十四）（《韵语阳秋》云：「余在毗陵，见孙润夫家有王维画孟浩然像，绢素败烂，丹青已渝。\n维题其上云：『维尝见孟公吟曰：「日暮马行疾，城荒人住稀。\n」又吟云：「挂席数千里，名都未逢。\n泊舟香炉峰。\n」余因美其风调，至所舍图於素轴。\n』」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52761.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52761","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}